Description: Implements estimation methods for structural equation models
    combining factors and composites, including a spectral estimator,
    a one-step constrained likelihood estimator, and restricted maximum
    likelihood. The package is provided to reproduce the numerical
    experiments of the accompanying anonymous submission.
